# Kit Plane B — ids goal.kit.* only.

goal goal.kit.capability-kernel
  statement: This repo is a multi-tenant capability kernel — @kit/* packages composed by independent product deploys, not a product domain monorepo.
  status: declared
  provenance: author
  appliesAtLevel: 6
  tag: kit
  link: file:AGENTS.md
  link: file:docs/kit/architecture/adr/0001-primary-axis-packages-compose-apps.md

goal goal.kit.tenant-isolation
  statement: organization is the tenant boundary; users, agents and runs stay inside organization grants; no cross-org ambient registry.
  status: declared
  provenance: author
  appliesAtLevel: 5
  tag: kit
  tag: security
  link: file:AGENTS.md

goal goal.kit.extractible-compose
  statement: A product composes this kit via fetch-only upstream without editing kit-owned zones; shared changes land in the kit first.
  status: declared
  provenance: author
  appliesAtLevel: 5
  tag: kit
  link: file:docs/kit/product-consumer-contract.md
  link: file:docs/kit/architecture/adr/0009-kit-namespace-polarity-inheritance-marker.md
